# ---------------------------------------------------------------- holdings
# No efficacy (33b) Holding: 29.1 says "a sign", not "only a sign" (finding).

<body/lbc-1689> gc:holds <holding/lbc-1689/baptism-perpetuity/standing-ordinance-to-the-end> .

